{"signature": "ee4181baa912b14fc11e77c4f945c64579ccb383334179f19543f84ad0d6bad6", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "slack", "file": "messages/C09EVVCFHKR/2025-09.json", "field": "ts", "values": ["1758281895.516859", "1758846729.451779", "1758899369.608129", "1758899400.476649"], "pointer": ""}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C09EVVCFHKR/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/39", "field": "ts", "value": "1758281895.516859", "record": {"id": "21a69c2050e3a02868ba405c2d750387", "ts": "1758281895.516859", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID", "text": "I updated the required token counts for Collect &amp; Win (Day 2 and Day 3). Can you apply the corresponding changes on the backend too? <@EMPLOYEE_0031_SLACK_ID>", "channel": "C09EVVCFHKR", "thread_ts": "1758281895.516859", "reply_count": 1, "reply_users_count": 1, "latest_reply": "1758281929.140049", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C09EVVCFHKR/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/87", "field": "ts", "value": "1758846729.451779", "record": {"id": "153e29deeb0479d5dc5c7c2ce7f9b6d1", "ts": "1758846729.451779", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hey guys, <@EMPLOYEE_0031_SLACK_ID> fixed from server first tokens ignored and event restart unexpectedly issues, same build will work to test these fixes.", "channel": "C09EVVCFHKR", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "100", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0031_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 1, "name": "+1::skin-tone-3", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C09EVVCFHKR/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/89", "field": "ts", "value": "1758899369.608129", "record": {"id": "ba8dc45d2eb7f3908efb14fc11d4d32c", "ts": "1758899369.608129", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0031_SLACK_ID> The blockers in the Collect&amp;Win event have been resolved, thank you guys :tada:  In the last tests we ran together with <@EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID>, we found some minor bugs and updated the canvas again. If we can handle the improvements and minor bugs on the canvas today, the Collect&amp;Win event will be in great shape :[USERNAME_33552]:", "channel": "C09EVVCFHKR", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "heart", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C09EVVCFHKR/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/90", "field": "ts", "value": "1758899400.476649", "record": {"id": "0069f6143e89802993b39e442d3baeb2", "ts": "1758899400.476649", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0031_SLACK_ID> I Also changed 1 reward in each of the two reward tables. Could you update them? We were giving users a time-based trampoline too early, which would have caused them to get through the first levels too quickly", "channel": "C09EVVCFHKR", "thread_ts": "1758899400.476649", "reply_count": 2, "reply_users_count": 1, "latest_reply": "1758899428.567489", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}], "records_checked": 102, "files_selected": 1, "files_completed": 1, "scan_complete": true, "errors": []}}, "files_read_this_call": 4, "sources": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C09EVVCFHKR/2025-09.json", "manifest_sha256": "7e3e8f820b1f98683b2c164b479c82cf92a874838208dcf81dfb9b4833444d1f", "freshness": "2d688f6ffab432c8bd206a218416ef8b66185a9522515f9a03c2863d97dc7a03"